# Natural Order cannot be cast with no green creature to sacrifice: Bot1 controls only a colorless Ornithopter and the refusal
# holds although it has the mana. A Llanowar Elves arrives (a mana ability is no help here; Bot1 has the mana from a Black Lotus) and the same
# spell is then castable - the positive control - sacrificing the Elves and not the Ornithopter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Llanowar Elves
Natural Order
Ornithopter
Island
Questing Beast
Island x10

